==Battleground==
*4 [[Celeboodle]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 5~15 seconds<sup>150f~450f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 15~30 seconds<sup>450f~900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Vega (Enemy)|Vega]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 40~40.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,220f</sup>.
**3 [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 40~40.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,220f</sup>.
**2 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 40~40.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,220f</sup>.
**3 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn, delay 40~40.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,220f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Vega is quite annoying, but has a large blindspot that can be easily exploited by rushers like [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] or melee cats. If you plan to bring a backliner for the other enemies, make sure it is freeze immune otherwise it will launch an attack very infrequently. Bring [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] if you have him, as there are many angels.

